	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="3">Microsoft to Quit Web Browsers for Mac</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">Microsoft Corp. said Friday it will no longer develop versions of its popular Web-browsing software for Apple Computer's Macintosh system, saying Apple's own browsing software is a logical choice for Mac users.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/8_ds_678745.asp">Full Story</a>
